// typed_a12_check_rt.h: round A12's differential check (a12_typed_check.cpp, generated by tools/typed_lift2.py --check-tu;
// docs/decomp_a12.md). Only the check translation unit and the offline harness (tools/a12_harness.cpp) include it. Made from
// typed_a11_check_rt.h by renaming (build/a12w/mk_ckrt12.py: a11ck -> a12ck, A11_OFFLINE -> A12_OFFLINE, PS2X_A11_CHECK ->
// PS2X_A12_CHECK; the matrix stack's a11x kept: the typed calls of typed_a11.inc / typed_a12.inc resolve to it in this TU) plus
// round A12's holder check of the twelve motion natives, GetCharacterClassOptionNodeGeo's and manager_sub_010AC4A0's (a12nchk, below: a check build wraps their slots; each call runs the lifted
// reference of the native's MIPS on the entry state first, its stores on the check's logged memory, then the native, and compares
// v0, every GPR (both halves), FPR, fcr31, hi / lo, VU0 register, ACC, Q, status, vi15 and every byte the reference stored, VU0's
// data memory included, with what the native left).
